{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/f52facf88053bb578e21c33a8e9cacfe.poster.avif?t=1755346357\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/f52facf88053bb578e21c33a8e9cacfe.webm?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/f52facf88053bb578e21c33a8e9cacfe.mp4?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Number Machine is an open-ended factory and automation game with math mechanics. Design, build, and optimize factories that automatically assemble and deliver complex numerical structures. Inspired by Opus Magnum and Infinifactory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/1decd0c41da41a3a0092429e2abe7c8b.poster.avif?t=1755346357\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/1decd0c41da41a3a0092429e2abe7c8b.webm?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/1decd0c41da41a3a0092429e2abe7c8b.mp4?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Build fully autonomous factories on a hexagonal grid using specialized machines. Move, combine, split, destroy, and modify numbered orbs with math to form the required structures with specific shapes and values.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/a2cb973834f1ee8a51ba24b626e866f7.poster.avif?t=1755346357\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/a2cb973834f1ee8a51ba24b626e866f7.webm?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/a2cb973834f1ee8a51ba24b626e866f7.mp4?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use conveyors, pushers, lasers, magnetism, rotators, and much more to create an efficient system. Optimize for size and speed to climb the leaderboards... but be wary: one small oversight and your entire design can fail<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/950fc86770ee7f6d8fa0d8d1dff1b2a3.poster.avif?t=1755346357\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/950fc86770ee7f6d8fa0d8d1dff1b2a3.webm?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/950fc86770ee7f6d8fa0d8d1dff1b2a3.mp4?t=1755346357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game features a unique cel-shaded art style that gives it a colorful, clean, and stylized look. All animations are seamless, with a single continuous camera movement from start to finish to keep you fully immersed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2231090?t=1755346357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/7848e5047570b567696ea76363756c147e38daed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755346357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/67c755c0da8b1d998159121cbe9d769e07817456/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755346357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/67c755c0d